  message: "From INV-gujoh's swift adjudication (PR #1158): two objc ledger rows have the constructor shapes that adjudication decided. NSMutableURLRequest.requestWithURL: builds a request value; the swift twin URLRequest was DELETED. NSFetchRequest.fetchRequestWithEntityName: composes a lazy query; the swift twin moved to db_compose. Decide their boundaries before re-kinding them, or the re-kind activates rows with wrong boundaries."  # f6fe
